		{"s": "syrus", "t": "Then the soup stays on the step. It is still warm. He knows the bowl.", "if": "m_ch11_wait", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "A bowl on a doorstep. It says the same thing as a knock. It just says it for longer.", "if": "m_ch11_wait", "cam": "close"},
		{"actor": "sato", "at": BLUE_OUT + Vector3(0.2, 0, 3.4), "face": "player", "from": BLUE_OUT + Vector3(0.6, 0, 7.6)},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "A team is not broken when the captain loses. It is broken when he decides to lose alone.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "He has not decided yet. That door is the whole season, and none of us can open it from this side.", "cam": "close"},
		{"actor": "dante", "at": BLUE_OUT + Vector3(-1.8, 0, 1.6), "face": "sato", "from": BLUE_OUT + Vector3(-1.4, 0, 6.4)},
		{"s": "dante", "t": "He lost. Now we know the ceiling of this team.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "You are on this team, Dante.", "do": "stomp"},
		{"s": "dante", "t": "I know exactly where I am.", "cam": "close"},
		{"move": "dante", "to": BLUE_OUT + Vector3(-1.6, 0, -3.4)},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I counted the people looking at that door. Five. I counted the people Dante looked at. None.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"gone": "dante"},
		{"merits": 30, "why": "A night at the captain's door"},
		# ---- night: your room
		{"scene": {"district": "academy", "inside": "yel_room_2", "pos": YROOM + Vector3(0.6, 0, 1.0), "yaw": 0.6, "tod": "night", "music": "shop"},
			"title": "Room 2", "sub": "The light in Blue is still on."},
		{"cine": true},
		{"actor": "lumen", "at": YROOM + Vector3(1.6, 0, 1.2), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I looked back the whole way here. One light, ground floor of Blue. Still on.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You beat the man who beat him. Tomorrow that will be very loud. Tonight it is only heavy.", "if": "aster_exhibition_won", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You lost to the man who beat him, and you lasted longer. He will know. I do not know yet if that helps.", "unless": "aster_exhibition_won", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "On Saturday a grey ship comes in, and there is a wall on it. Sleep. Somebody on this team has to.", "cam": "close"},
