		{"s": "nico", "t": "Two to one! I said it into a real microphone and it echoed. The second echo was better than the first.", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "bastion", "t": "One match played, one won. For the first time since I opened it, the League page of my file is pleasant to read.", "do": "chat"},
